To flash them we need a 
  CC debugger  $10-15 Which I will order when I get back from Iceland.

  Zigbee Emulator CC-Debugger USB Programmer CC2540 CC2531 
    Sniffer Wireless Bluetooth 4.0 Module Connector Downloader Cable
  



Download PACKET-SNIFFER from:
  https://www.ti.com/tool/PACKET-SNIFFER
    to /tmp/WORK

In /tmp/WORK
  nix-shell -p p7zip --run '7z x swrc045z.zip -oPACKET-SNIFFER && 7z e PACKET-SNIFFER/Setup_SmartRF_Packet_Sniffer_2.18.0.exe bin/general/firmware/sniffer_fw_cc2531.hex'
ls -l sniffer_fw_cc2531.hex

rori@49ers 2026-11-10 14:11:24 /tmp/WORK $ ls -lrt
total 23028
-rw-r--r-- 1 drori users    23190 Jun 19  2014 sniffer_fw_cc2531.hex
-rw-r--r-- 1 drori users 23553042 Nov 10 14:07 swrc045z.zip
drwx------ 1 drori users      176 Nov 10 14:11 PACKET-SNIFFER

Plugin to USB the following:
  1) The sniffer. (Has an antenna)
  2) The CC DEbugger.   
      Connect them with cables 
      Make sure the red part on the ribbon goes to the Antenna
      Make sure the RED In the connector is in the same direction as the Incoming cables RED wire.

BE CAREFULL!! 
CHECK PHOTOS:
SOME OF THE CONNECTORS HAVE 6 PINS And are connected to a cable with more WIRES
BE CAREFULL!! 



